    {
      "name": "Audit Log",
      "description": "Read-only view of the immutable admin action trail (`admin_audit_logs`). Super admin only — sub-admins receive 403.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Audit Log",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/audit-log?page=1&limit=25&action=&module=&adminId=",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "admin",
                "audit-log"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "25",
                  "description": "1-100, default 20"
                },
                {
                  "key": "action",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Case-insensitive `contains` match on the stored action, so `approve` matches `verification.approve`. Empty = no filter."
                },
                {
                  "key": "module",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Portal module name (`experts`, `verifications`, `categories`, `admins`, `cms`, ...) resolved to the matching `entityType` values, or a raw `entityType` substring. Empty = no filter."
                },
                {
                  "key": "adminId",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Actor admin UUID. A malformed UUID returns 400. Empty = no filter."
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Paginated admin audit trail, newest first.\n\n**Auth**: `requireAdmin` + `requireSuperAdmin` — sub-admins get 403.\n\n**Response**\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"message\": \"Audit log loaded\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"items\": [\n      {\n        \"id\": \"uuid\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-31T07:21:50.911Z\",\n        \"adminId\": \"uuid\",\n        \"adminName\": \"Ops Admin\",\n        \"action\": \"verification.approve\",\n        \"module\": \"ExpertVerification\",\n        \"targetId\": \"uuid\",\n        \"targetName\": null,\n        \"details\": \"notes: Auto-approved\",\n        \"ipAddress\": \"127.0.0.1\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"page\": 1,\n    \"limit\": 25,\n    \"total\": 17\n  }\n}\n```\n\nThe trail is append-only — there is no create/update/delete route for audit rows."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
