    {
      "name": "Real-time Events (SSE)",
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "sse-001",
          "name": "Subscribe to Admin SSE Stream",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "text/event-stream"
              },
              {
                "key": "Cache-Control",
                "value": "no-cache"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/events",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "admin",
                "events"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Opens a persistent Server-Sent Events (SSE) connection. The server streams events as they occur in the platform.\n\n**Authentication**: Valid admin JWT required.\n\n**Client usage (React admin portal)**:\n```js\nconst es = new EventSource(`${API_BASE}/api/v1/admin/events`, {\n  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${adminToken}` }\n});\n\nes.addEventListener('ticket:created', e => {\n  const ticket = JSON.parse(e.data);\n  // show toast / update badge count\n});\n\nes.addEventListener('verification:submitted', e => { ... });\nes.addEventListener('report:filed', e => { ... });\nes.addEventListener('consultation:completed', e => { ... });\nes.addEventListener('user:registered', e => { ... });\nes.addEventListener('review:flagged', e => { ... });\n\nes.onerror = () => es.close();\n```\n\n**Polling interval**: DB is polled every 5 seconds. Maximum latency before an event appears = 5 s.\n\n**Heartbeat**: Server sends a `: ping` SSE comment every 25 s to keep the connection alive through proxies."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sse-002",
          "name": "SSE Connection Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
